everage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 30.6%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.25"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":153.64,"default_fair_val":153.64,"premium_pct":63.16388961208019,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":20.1,"pe_forward":17.7,"pb_trailing":4.7,"pb_forward":4.2,"div_yield":2.27,"ps_ratio":5.2,"fcf_to_ev":3.27,"fcf_to_mcap":4.78,"liab_to_assets":30.6,"cash_to_assets":9.7,"current_ratio":1.25,"roe":23.4,"roa":16.2,"moat":{"ticker":"ERIE","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"ERIE 在財產與意外險領域擁有穩固的品牌聲譽，這使其在面對競爭時具備一定的定價能力。其品牌忠誠度體現在客戶續保率上，顯示客戶認可其提供的價值與服務。雖然保險業整體價格競爭激烈，ERIE 的品牌價值仍能支撐其在特定市場區隔維持相對穩定的利潤率，這是一種無形的資產，讓其在市場波動中相對穩定。","comment_en":"ERIE possesses a solid brand reputation within the property and casualty insurance sector, granting it a degree of pricing power against competitors. Customer loyalty is evident in its renewal rates, indicating clients value the service and protection offered. While the insurance industry is generally price-competitive, ERIE's brand equity allows it to maintain relatively stable margins in its chosen market segments, acting as an intangible asset that provides resilience during market fluctuations."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"保險業受到嚴格的監管，這本身就構成了一定的進入壁壘。ERIE 在此監管環境中長期穩健經營，證明了其合規能力和對複雜法規的適應性。雖然沒有傳統意義上的專利，但其在特定地區或產品線上的營運許可和牌照，以及對法規的深入理解和利用，構成了其經營的護城河。這種受監管的特許經營模式，限制了新進入者的競爭。","comment_en":"The insurance industry is heavily regulated, which inherently creates barriers to entry. ERIE's long-term, stable operation within this regulatory framework demonstrates its compliance capabilities and adaptability to complex rules. While lacking traditional patents, its operating licenses and permits in specific regions or product lines, coupled with a deep understanding and utilization of regulations, form its operational moat. This regulated franchise model limits competition from new entrants."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"對於個人和小型企業客戶而言，更換保險提供商的轉換成本相對較低，主要涉及時間和精力。然而，對於長期客戶，特別是那些依賴 ERIE 提供的特定保障方案或與其代理網絡建立緊密關係的客戶，轉換的複雜性和潛在的保障中斷風險會增加其轉換成本。ERIE 的客戶留存率顯示，其服務和關係能有效降低客戶流失。","comment_en":"For individual and small business clients, the cost of switching insurance providers is relatively low, primarily involving time and effort. However, for long-term clients, especially those reliant on ERIE's specific coverage plans or who have established strong relationships with its agency network, the complexity and potential risk of coverage gaps increase switching costs. ERIE's customer retention rates indicate that its service and relationships effectively mitigate churn."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"ERIE 的商業模式主要基於代理網絡和客戶服務，而非直接的網絡效應。雖然其代理網絡的廣泛性可能帶來一定的協同效應，但這並非典型的、由用戶數量直接驅動的網絡效應壁壘。客戶選擇保險公司更多基於價格、保障範圍和品牌聲譽，而非其他用戶的使用情況。因此，此維度的護城河較弱。","comment_en":"ERIE's business model relies primarily on its agency network and customer service, rather than direct network effects. While the breadth of its agency network might offer some synergistic benefits, it does not represent a typical network effect moat driven by user numbers. Customer choice in insurance is more influenced by price, coverage, and brand reputation than by the usage of other customers. Therefore, the moat in this dimension is weak."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"作為一家大型保險公司，ERIE 受益於規模經濟，能夠在承保、理賠處理和營運管理上實現成本效率。其龐大的保單基礎有助於分散風險，並可能從供應商處獲得更有利的條款。這種規模優勢使其能夠在價格上與小型競爭對手區隔開來，並在市場上保持競爭力，同時維持健康的利潤率。","comment_en":"As a large insurance provider, ERIE benefits from economies of scale, enabling cost efficiencies in underwriting, claims processing, and operational management. Its substantial policy base helps in risk diversification and potentially secures more favorable terms from suppliers. This scale advantage allows it to differentiate on price from smaller competitors and maintain market competitiveness while preserving healthy profit margins."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"ERIE 在美國東北部地區，特別是賓夕法尼亞州，擁有深厚的市場根基和廣泛的代理網絡。這種區域性的市場滲透和品牌認知度，對於希望進入該市場的競爭對手而言，是一個顯著的障礙。其長期建立的客戶關係和對當地市場的深入了解，構成了其獨特的地理優勢。","comment_en":"ERIE has a deep market presence and extensive agency network in the Northeastern United States, particularly in Pennsylvania. This regional market penetration and brand recognition pose a significant barrier for competitors seeking to enter this market. Its long-established customer relationships and intimate knowledge of the local market constitute a unique geographical advantage."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"ERIE 長期以來展現出卓越的營運效率，其高 ROE 和 ROA 反映了這一點。公司能夠在控制成本的同時，提供高質量的客戶服務和理賠處理。其精算能力和風險管理體系，使其能夠在複雜的市場環境中持續產生超額回報，這顯示了其營運上的優勢。","comment_en":"ERIE has consistently demonstrated exceptional operational efficiency, reflected in its high ROE and ROA. The company effectively controls costs while delivering high-quality customer service and claims processing. Its actuarial expertise and risk management systems enable it to generate superior returns in a complex market environment, highlighting its operational prowess."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"ERIE 的管理層在資本配置方面表現出色，專注於核心保險業務的穩健增長和盈利能力。公司透過審慎的承保策略和有效的風險管理來優化資本使用。同時，其穩定的自由現金流生成能力，為股東回報（如股息和股票回購）提供了堅實基礎，顯示了其明智的資本運用。","comment_en":"ERIE's management excels in capital allocation, focusing on the steady growth and profitability of its core insurance business. The company optimizes capital usage through prudent underwriting strategies and effective risk management. Furthermore, its consistent free cash flow generation provides a strong basis for shareholder returns, such as dividends and share buybacks, demonstrating wise capital deployment."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"ERIE 的高客戶續保率是其強大客戶關係和服務質量的直接體現。客戶黏性是其重要的護城河，因為獲取新客戶的成本通常高於維護現有客戶。這種穩定的客戶基礎為公司提供了可預測的收入來源，並減少了對市場波動的敏感性。","comment_en":"ERIE's high customer renewal rates are a direct reflection of its strong customer relationships and service quality. Customer stickiness serves as a significant moat, as acquiring new customers is typically more costly than retaining existing ones. This stable customer base provides the company with predictable revenue streams and reduces its sensitivity to market fluctuations."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"ERIE 在財產與意外險這個相對成熟且穩定的行業中運營，該行業的需求具有一定的剛性。儘管面臨經濟週期和自然災害的影響，但其穩健的財務狀況、卓越的營運效率和強大的客戶忠誠度，使其能夠長期抵禦衝擊，保持業務的持久性。","comment_en":"ERIE operates in the relatively mature and stable property and casualty insurance sector, where demand is somewhat inelastic. Despite exposure to economic cycles and natural disasters, its robust financial position, operational excellence, and strong customer loyalty enable it to withstand shocks over the long term, ensuring business durability."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"ERIE 在財產與意外險領域展現出穩固的經濟護城河，主要體現為其強大的品牌聲譽（M1）、嚴格的行業監管壁壘（M2）、卓越的營運效率（M7）和明智的資本配置（M8）。其在特定區域市場的深厚根基（M6）和高客戶留存率（M9）進一步鞏固了其競爭優勢。雖然網絡效應（M4）較弱，但規模經濟（M5）和相對較高的轉換成本（M3）也提供了支持。整體而言，ERIE 類似於一個受監管的特許經營模式，其持久性（M10）和管理層的穩健風格，使其成為一個具有長期價值潛力的投資標的。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"ERIE exhibits a solid economic moat in the property and casualty insurance sector, primarily driven by its strong brand reputation (M1), regulatory barriers (M2), operational efficiency (M7), and prudent capital allocation (M8). Its deep regional market penetration (M6) and high customer retention (M9) further solidify its competitive advantage. While network effects (M4) are weak, economies of scale (M5) and moderate switching costs (M3) provide additional support. Overall, ERIE operates much like a regulated franchise, with durability (M10) and a conservative management approach making it a compelling long-term value investment.","evidenceHash":"78d73bfa0de937ea13e0f5df5bcf66f9ee248cacb08289200a07250014f7581c","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":true,"reference":{"date":"2026-06-30","label":"FY 2026 Q2","period":"quarterly","flow":"ttm","balance":"beginning","rote":26.849619126946827,"warnings":[],"tbvps":53.41316457779,"reason":null},"rote":26.849619126946827,"tbvps":53.41316457779,"bvps":53.41316457779,"g":2.25,"dps_total":5.701669874494199,"dps_source":"ttmQuarterly","dps_source_date":"2026-06-30","pb_tangible":4.693318622507505,"ke_floor_pct":9,"ke_floor_applied":true,"ke_capm":5.8675,"ke":9,"excess_return_fair":194.66,"ddm_fair":103.51},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ERIE.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ERIE.png","website":"https://www.erieinsurance.com","ceo":"Timothy G. NeCastro","full_time_employees":"6667","description":"Erie Indemnity Company operates as a managing attorney-in-fact for the subscribers at the Erie Insurance Exchange in the United States. It provides issuance and renewal services; sales related services, including agent compensation and sales and advertising support services; underwriting services that include underwriting and policy processing; and other services consist of customer services and administrative support services, as well as information technology services. The company was incorporated in 1925 and is based in Erie, Pennsylvania.","description_en":"Erie Indemnity Company operates as a managing attorney-in-fact for the subscribers at the Erie Insurance Exchange in the United States. It provides issuance and renewal services; sales related services, including agent compensation and sales and advertising support services; underwriting services that include underwriting and policy processing; and other services consist of customer services and administrative support services, as well as information technology services. The company was incorporated in 1925 and is based in Erie, Pennsylvania.","description_zh":"好的，身為資深證券分析師，我將為您翻譯並精煉 Erie Indemnity Company (ERIE) 的業務營運描述，以符合台灣財經用語的習慣，並確保內容的客觀嚴謹與詳實。\n\n**Erie Indemnity Company (ERIE) 業務營運精煉（繁體中文 - 台灣財經用語）**\n\nErie Indemnity Company (ERIE) 主要扮演美國 Erie Insurance Exchange（Erie 保險交易所）之訂戶（subscribers）的「管理律師代理人」（managing attorney-in-fact）角色。其核心業務聚焦於為 Erie Insurance Exchange 提供全面的營運支援服務。具體而言，公司負責保單的核發與續約作業，並提供與銷售相關的服務，包含代理人佣金支付、銷售推廣及廣告支援。此外，ERIE 也承擔保單承保與處理的職能，確保保險產品的風險評估與流程順暢。其他營運範疇則涵蓋客戶服務、行政支援以及資訊科技（IT）服務的提供。該公司成立於 1925 年，總部位於賓州伊利市。其營運模式透過提供專業的後勤與管理服務，支持 Erie Insurance Exchange 的保險業務運作。","address":"100 Erie Insurance Place","city":"Erie","state":"PA","zip":"16530","country":"US","phone":"814 870 2000","full_address":"100 Erie Insurance Place, Erie, PA 16530, US","range_52w":"204.63-330.54","year_high":330.54,"year_low":204.63,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":204.63,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-22","name":"Srinivasa Parthasarathy","title":"officer: EVP, Chief Information Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":16,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-22","name":"Shine Sarah","title":"officer: Executive Vice President","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":16,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-22","name":"Pelkowski Julie Marie","title":"officer: EVP & CFO","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":12,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-22","name":"Novacek Jorie L","title":"officer: SVP, Controller","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":5,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-22","name":"NECASTRO TIMOTHY G","title":"officer: President & CEO","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":77,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-22","name":"Dugan Sean","title":"officer: Executive Vice President","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":7,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-22","name":"Cook Cody","title":"officer: Executive Vice President","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":7,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-22","name":"Cipriani Marc","title":"officer: Senior Vice President","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":13,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-22","name":"Bolash Brian W.","title":"officer: EVP,Secretary,General Counsel","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":21,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-21","name":"Palmer Thomas W","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":95,"price":0,"total_val":0}],"stock_splits":[{"date":"1996-05-13","ratio":"3 : 1","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"}],"fmp_symbol":"ERIE","real_5y_prices":[],"historical_dcf_series":[],"name_en":"Erie Indemnity Company","expansion":{"status":"available","capturedAt":"2026-10-22T14:32:03.758Z","reason":null,"detailPath":"cache/us_companies/ERIE.json"},"rf":4.3,"erp":4.75},"snapshot":null,"model":null}
